MultiLingualTexts:
  - id: MLC_3KN
    en-US: trigger from app to start
  - id: MLC_3DA
    en-US: trigger from app to stop
  - id: MLC_3ik
    en-US: trigger from app to reset
  - id: MLC_3tC
    en-US: string from app containing QR code (scanning app)
  - id: MLC_3Ht
    en-US: activate automatically error simulation (true = active)
  - id: MLC_3Qk
    en-US: generate a manual error (true = error)
  - id: MLC_3E9
    en-US: trigger from app to generate program alarm
